    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 668 of the laws of 1977, amending the volunteer\nfirefighters' benefit law relating to disability due to disease or malfunction\nof the heart or coronary arteries, in relation to the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S8011",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8011-2025",
